# 🚀 Backend Task Management API (Node.js & Express)

A modular and clean RESTful API built with **Node.js** and **Express.js** to handle task management operations. Designed with maintainability in mind using an MVC-inspired folder architecture, robust input handling, custom security middleware, and full Postman testing.

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```text
├── controllers/
│   └── taskController.js    # Logic for task handling (CRUD)
├── middleware/
│   └── security.js          # Custom security & validation middleware
├── routes/
│   └── taskRoutes.js        # Express routing for API endpoints
├── package.json             # Node.js dependencies and scripts
└── server.js                # Server entry point and configuration
